<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.75in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span id="xdx_F07_zI1MrvxKSw15" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(*)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">During 2020, Gix Media engaged with a subcontractor for the development of an internal-use software (the &#8220;Software&#8221;). Gix Media
    capitalized its developments costs until March 1, 2022 and from this date the Software became available for use. Accordingly, Gix
    Media recognized amortization expenses over the estimated useful life of the Software determined to be three years. For the three
    months ended March 31, 2023, and the period from March 1, 2022, until December 31, 2022, Gix Media recorded amortization expenses of
    $<span id="xdx_905_ecustom--IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization_pn3n3_c20230101__20230331__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__us-gaap--SoftwareDevelopmentMember_zxZIJmazN8Bg" title="Amortization expenses" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEdPT0RXSUxMIEFORCBJTlRBTkdJQkxFIEFTU0VUUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="VBIX:IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-03-31_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">35</ix:nonFraction>
    and $<span id="xdx_908_ecustom--IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization_pn3n3_c20220301__20221231__us-gaap--PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis__us-gaap--SoftwareDevelopmentMember_zOfDcVAu7dch" title="Amortization expenses" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIEdPT0RXSUxMIEFORCBJTlRBTkdJQkxFIEFTU0VUUyAoRGV0YWlscykgKFBhcmVudGhldGljYWwpAA__"><ix:nonFraction name="VBIX:IntangibleAssetsNetIncludingGoodwilAmortization" contextRef="From2022-03-012022-12-31_us-gaap_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">122</ix:nonFraction></span>,
    respectively.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A9_zHc9M6TvU912" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&#160;</p>


