<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 71.7pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.85pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>D.
Short term loan:</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
December 18, 2020, the Company entered into a loan agreement and Stock Subscription Agreement with certain Investors, pursuant to which
the Investors lent an aggregate amount of $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn3n3_c20201218__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--InvestorsMember_zJEk88FBLRt2"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember_custom_InvestorsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">69</ix:nonFraction>
</span></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">at an annual interest rate of <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_c20201218__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--InvestorsMember_zkRLwAD7vLQl"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_LoanAndStockSubscriptionAgreementMember_custom_InvestorsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">8</ix:nonFraction></span>% (the &#8220;Loan&#8221;).
</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 53.85pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
January 2023, the Company reached an agreement with the investors that the Loan received will be <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFrequencyOfPeriodicPayment_c20230101__20230131_z8dMXcAhFKB6" title="Equal monthly payments"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-012023-01-31" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFrequencyOfPeriodicPayment">repaid in 3 equal monthly payments</ix:nonNumeric></span>.
As of the date of approval of these financial statements, the Loan was fully repaid by the Company.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


